Verse 1:
[Bb]O Thou who hearest every [Cm]heartfelt [Bb]prayer,
[Gm]With [A]Thy [A7/Db]rich [Dm]grace, Lord, [F/C]all our [Cm]hearts prepare;
[F]Thou art our [F7]life, Thou art our love and light,
[Bb]Olet [Cm]this [Bb/D]Sabbath [Eb]hour [Bb/F]with Thee [Gm]be [Bb/F]bright. [F7]Amen.
